pan></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Injective}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S,\\mathrm{Function},\\mathrm{Injective}_S\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f,T,\\leq_T,U,\\leq_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(U,\\leq_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,T,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left(\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle f(s),f(t)\\rangle\\in\\leq_U\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}tree\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f,T,\\leq_T,U,\\leq_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(T,\\leq_T)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree8TreeOrder}_S(U,\\leq_U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}_S(f,T,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall s,t\\in T\\;\n\\left(\n\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in\\leq_T\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle f(s),f(t)\\rangle\\in\\leq_U\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This direct definition breaks the former circular dependency with the\ninclusion-ordered specialization in batch11.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"i